{"id":"c022","number":22,"title":"不用等","label":"第二十二章 不用等","volumeId":"v2","sourceHeadingParagraph":1785,"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"十月初，学院紧锣密鼓筹备迎新晚会。","sourceParagraph":1786},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼一下子被卷入繁杂的忙碌之中。","sourceParagraph":1787},{"type":"paragraph","text":"她所在专业接下了晚会宣传片的拍摄任务，接连数日，在教学楼、礼堂与操场之间来回辗转奔波。有些清晨，幕走到图书馆熟悉的座位，对面位置空空荡荡，见不到那个人的踪影；偶尔正午时分，手机会弹出来旼简短的问候「吃了吗」，幕还没回复，十来分钟过后，等来的却往往是一句带着歉意的「算了，我来不及」。","sourceParagraph":1788},{"type":"paragraph","text":"确定关系之后，二人能够相伴的时光，反倒不比从前更多。","sourceParagraph":1789},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一开始，幕心底会漫开一层淡淡的不适应。","sourceParagraph":1790},{"type":"paragraph","text":"还没有成为情侣的时候，他从不会为见不到面这件事反复纠结。旼来，便一起静坐；旼不来，他便安守书本，沉下心阅读。可身份转变之后，每一次落空的相约，心底就会浮起一小块空荡荡的缺口，浅浅地悬在那里。","sourceParagraph":1791},{"type":"paragraph","text":"但他把这份心绪悄悄收好，什么都没有向旼提起。","sourceParagraph":1792},{"type":"paragraph","text":"周四下午，幕踏出教学楼，晚风卷着秋意擦过肩头，手机屏幕忽然亮起，是旼发来的消息。","sourceParagraph":1793},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「晚上别等我吃饭。」","sourceParagraph":1794},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕站在教学楼的台阶下，目光落在这行字上，指尖在屏幕上顿了顿。","sourceParagraph":1795},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他回复：「几点结束？」","sourceParagraph":1796},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼：「不知道。」","sourceParagraph":1797},{"type":"paragraph","text":"隔片刻又补了一句：「可能九点。」","sourceParagraph":1798},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕敲下文字：「这么晚？」","sourceParagraph":1799},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「要补几组镜头。」","sourceParagraph":1800},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「在哪？」","sourceParagraph":1801},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「礼堂。」","sourceParagraph":1802},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕稍稍思忖，回了一个：「好。」","sourceParagraph":1803},{"type":"paragraph","text":"对话框就此沉寂，旼没有再发来只言片语。","sourceParagraph":1804},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕把手机揣进外套口袋，独自往食堂走去。","sourceParagraph":1805},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他照旧选了靠窗的老位置，点了一贯吃的饭菜。碗筷碰撞之间吃到一半，视线无意识飘向对面空置的座椅，恍惚间忆起往日，旼坐在这里，总会轻声提醒他不要吃得太急。","sourceParagraph":1806},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕轻轻晃了晃神，收回目光，低头继续安静吃饭。","sourceParagraph":1807},{"type":"paragraph","text":"吃完饭，六点十分。","sourceParagraph":1808},{"type":"paragraph","text":"按照往日的节奏，他该返回图书馆。行至道路分岔口，视线却不受控制地偏向礼堂的方向。","sourceParagraph":1809},{"type":"paragraph","text":"暮色已经完完全全笼罩校园。","sourceParagraph":1810},{"type":"paragraph","text":"远处的礼堂灯火尽数亮起，明晃晃的光从敞开的大门倾泻出来。门口人来人往，有人搬运演出道具，有人怀抱着堆叠的演出服饰，还有学生站在高高的台阶上调试音响，喧嚣的人声隔着一段距离，随风断断续续飘过来。","sourceParagraph":1811},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕在原地静静伫立片刻，最后还是调转脚步，走向图书馆。","sourceParagraph":1812},{"type":"paragraph","text":"八点二十，他已经读完书中完整的一个章节。","sourceParagraph":1813},{"type":"paragraph","text":"拿起手机，屏幕安安静静，没有新消息推送。","sourceParagraph":1814},{"type":"paragraph","text":"八点四十五分，屏幕依旧一片沉寂。","sourceParagraph":1815},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕将手机屏幕朝下扣在桌面，逼着自己把注意力放回书页。可翻过两三页之后才察觉，文字只是在眼前掠过，完全落不进心里，思绪总是不受控制地飘向礼堂那片亮堂的灯火。","sourceParagraph":1816},{"type":"paragraph","text":"九点整，图书馆柔和的闭馆广播缓缓在大厅回荡。幕收拢书本，背起书包走出馆门。","sourceParagraph":1817},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夜里的气温比前些日子又往下跌落几分。秋风吹过行道的梧桐，枝叶摩擦，簌簌的声响连绵不绝。幕将外套拉链拉到一半，立在图书馆门口。","sourceParagraph":1818},{"type":"paragraph","text":"回宿舍要往左手边走，而礼堂，在右手边。","sourceParagraph":1819},{"type":"paragraph","text":"只是短暂的一番内心权衡，他便抬步，朝着礼堂走去。","sourceParagraph":1820},{"type":"paragraph","text":"礼堂门口比几小时前冷清了不少，主门依旧敞开，内部灯火通明。幕没有迈步走进去，只是在门外冰凉的石阶边上坐了下来，书包搁在身侧。","sourceParagraph":1821},{"type":"paragraph","text":"九点十分，陆续有学生说说笑笑从礼堂走出来，一部分拍摄工作已经收尾。","sourceParagraph":1822},{"type":"paragraph","text":"九点二十，一名男生抱着三脚架跨出大门，路过时目光扫过静坐台阶上的幕，脚步未停，匆匆走远。","sourceParagraph":1823},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕低头看向手机。","sourceParagraph":1824},{"type":"paragraph","text":"聊天记录还停留在下午那一句「晚上别等我吃饭」。","sourceParagraph":1825},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他盯着那行文字看了几秒。","sourceParagraph":1826},{"type":"paragraph","text":"心底冒出来一个细小的念头：她只叫我不要等吃饭，并没有说不要等她本人。","sourceParagraph":1827},{"type":"paragraph","text":"念头刚落，他又暗自自嘲，觉得这不过是自己给自己找的借口。于是把手机重新塞回口袋，不再去想。","sourceParagraph":1828},{"type":"paragraph","text":"九点四十，夜风的寒意愈发浓重。","sourceParagraph":1829},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕站起身，轻轻跺了跺坐得发麻的双腿，背着书包沿着礼堂外墙慢慢踱了两圈活动筋骨，之后又回到石阶边上继续等候。","sourceParagraph":1830},{"type":"paragraph","text":"十点零五分，一大群人谈笑喧闹地从礼堂里面涌出来。幕抬眼，一眼就看见队伍末尾的旼。","sourceParagraph":1831},{"type":"paragraph","text":"她怀里抱着厚厚一叠文稿，帆布包斜挎在肩头，侧过头正和身边的同学交谈。话音落下的一瞬，她无意抬眼，视线直直撞上石阶之下的幕。","sourceParagraph":1832},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼的脚步骤然顿住。","sourceParagraph":1833},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕也站在原地，没有主动上前，也没有出声呼唤。","sourceParagraph":1834},{"type":"paragraph","text":"短短数秒的静默过后，旼迈步朝他走过来，眉头轻轻收拢，眼底藏着一点意料之外的错愕。","sourceParagraph":1835},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「你怎么在这？」","sourceParagraph":1836},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「等你。」","sourceParagraph":1837},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼定定地望着他，目光沉沉。","sourceParagraph":1838},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「你什么时候过来的？」","sourceParagraph":1839},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕在心里粗略回溯时间，没有立刻作答。","sourceParagraph":1840},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「差不多九点。」","sourceParagraph":1841},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼眉峰蹙得更紧。","sourceParagraph":1842},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「九点？」","sourceParagraph":1843},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「嗯。」","sourceParagraph":1844},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「现在已经十点多了。」","sourceParagraph":1845},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「我知道。」","sourceParagraph":1846},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕心中原本隐隐预想过几种场面，以为她或许会浅浅笑他傻，或是习惯性伸手把重物递过来让他分担。","sourceParagraph":1847},{"type":"paragraph","text":"可这些全都没有发生。她就只是安安静静地看着他，神色敛着，看不出半分戏谑。","sourceParagraph":1848},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「我不是说了，别等我。」","sourceParagraph":1849},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕微微一怔，睫毛轻轻颤动。","sourceParagraph":1850},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「你说的是，别等我吃饭。」","sourceParagraph":1851},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼沉默两秒，眉眼间漫开一层无奈。","sourceParagraph":1852},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「这二者之间，有很大区别吗。」","sourceParagraph":1853},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕一时语塞，找不到合适的说辞来辩驳。","sourceParagraph":1854},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「晚饭我已经吃过了。」他慌忙开口，话音落下才意识到，这句话听上去，反倒更像无力的托词。","sourceParagraph":1855},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼望着他，语调平稳。","sourceParagraph":1856},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「我在意的并不是你吃没吃饭这件事。」","sourceParagraph":1857},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕抿住嘴唇，不再辩解。连他自己也说不清，今晚执意留在这里等候，心底真正的动因究竟是什么。","sourceParagraph":1858},{"type":"paragraph","text":"礼堂里面还有人在收拾器材，远处飘来几声模糊的呼喊，很快消散在沉沉夜色之中。","sourceParagraph":1859},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼把怀里沉甸甸的文稿换到另一只手臂托住，纸张摩擦发出细碎的沙沙声响。","sourceParagraph":1860},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「为什么不直接回宿舍。」","sourceParagraph":1861},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「我想要等你收工。」","sourceParagraph":1862},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「为什么。」","sourceParagraph":1863},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕僵在原地。","sourceParagraph":1864},{"type":"paragraph","text":"这个问题他从前从未认真梳理过，脑海里闪过一堆零碎的想法：他们现在是情侣；她收工得太晚；女生一个人走夜路不安全；作为男朋友理应……","sourceParagraph":1865},{"type":"paragraph","text":"思绪走到这里，幕猛地停住。","sourceParagraph":1866},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼敏锐捕捉到他眼神一闪而过的犹疑。","sourceParagraph":1867},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「你是不是又在心里认定，这是你理所应当该去完成的事？」","sourceParagraph":1868},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕没有开口回答。","sourceParagraph":1869},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼轻轻吐了一口气，算不上重重的叹息，但幕能够清晰感知到，她的情绪已经沉了下去。","sourceParagraph":1870},{"type":"paragraph","text":"这是他们相识一年多以来，幕第一次真切感受到，旼正在生气。","sourceParagraph":1871},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他下意识低声开口：「对不起。」","sourceParagraph":1872},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼抬眼看向他，眼里带着一丝疑惑。","sourceParagraph":1873},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「你为什么要道歉？」","sourceParagraph":1874},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕愣了愣。","sourceParagraph":1875},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「你在生气。」","sourceParagraph":1876},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「我确实生气了。」","sourceParagraph":1877},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼回答得直白干脆，没有刻意掩饰情绪。","sourceParagraph":1878},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕的手指不自觉攥紧书包的背带，指节微微用力，这个细小的动作被旼尽收眼底。","sourceParagraph":1879},{"type":"paragraph","text":"她安静片刻，刻意把语调放得缓和，不想让气氛继续僵持。","sourceParagraph":1880},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「幕，我生气，不是因为你过来接我。」","sourceParagraph":1881},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕抬起头，眼底盛满困惑：「那是因为什么。」","sourceParagraph":1882},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「是我已经明确跟你说过，不用等。」","sourceParagraph":1883},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「可是——」","sourceParagraph":1884},{"type":"paragraph","text":"还不等幕把话说完，旼继续往下讲。","sourceParagraph":1885},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「你心里想要留下来等我，这份心意没有错。但你至少要提前告诉我。」","sourceParagraph":1886},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕缄默地站在晚风之中。","sourceParagraph":1887},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「你可以发一条消息，说我在礼堂门口；也可以先来问我一句，需不需要我等。就算我回复不用，你依旧选择留下，那是属于你的决定。」","sourceParagraph":1888},{"type":"paragraph","text":"她稍稍停顿，夜色落在她的侧脸，轮廓柔和却态度分明。","sourceParagraph":1889},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「可你什么都没有跟我说。」","sourceParagraph":1890},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕静静凝望着她。","sourceParagraph":1891},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「就一个人在这里，吹了将近一个小时的夜风。」","sourceParagraph":1892},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「还没有满一个小时。」","sourceParagraph":1893},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼淡淡扫了他一眼，幕识趣地闭住嘴。","sourceParagraph":1894},{"type":"paragraph","text":"隔了两秒，旼轻声道：「五十多分钟，本质上没有多大差别。」","sourceParagraph":1895},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕垂下脑袋，目光落在脚边地砖的缝隙上。","sourceParagraph":1896},{"type":"paragraph","text":"晚风穿过二人中间，呼呼掠过。怀中文稿的纸页被风掀起边角，哗啦哗啦作响，旼连忙抬手按住散乱的纸张。","sourceParagraph":1897},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「我不喜欢这样。」她说。","sourceParagraph":1898},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕抬眼看向她。","sourceParagraph":1899},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「哪样？」","sourceParagraph":1900},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「很多事情，你自顾自就替两个人做好了决定。」","sourceParagraph":1901},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕一时无言。听见这句话，心底浮起一种微妙的错位感。","sourceParagraph":1902},{"type":"paragraph","text":"长久以来，明明一直是旼，习惯凡事把「我自己来」挂在心底。","sourceParagraph":1903},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼仿佛也察觉到这份矛盾，短暂顿了顿，气息放轻。","sourceParagraph":1904},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「我知道。」她轻声说，「我也会做出同样的事。」","sourceParagraph":1905},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕依旧沉默，听她继续诉说。","sourceParagraph":1906},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「所以我才清楚，这种自作主张的对待，会给人带来多大的困扰。」","sourceParagraph":1907},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕抬眸望向她的眼睛。","sourceParagraph":1908},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夜色里，旼唇角扯出一抹浅浅的笑，转瞬就被晚风冲淡，紧绷的气氛稍稍松快下来。","sourceParagraph":1909},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「你想要对我好，完全没有问题。」她看着幕，缓缓说道，「但是你不能单方面替我定义，什么才叫做对我好。」","sourceParagraph":1910},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕立在凉凉的晚风里。这些话语语气并不凌厉，却一字一句，清清楚楚烙印在他心上。","sourceParagraph":1911},{"type":"paragraph","text":"之后两人并肩朝着宿舍区走去。经过一整日拍摄劳作，旼身心俱疲，脚步比往日放缓许多，幕也随之放慢步伐，配合她的节奏。","sourceParagraph":1912},{"type":"paragraph","text":"路过操场外围的时候，晚风裹挟着操场草木的气息吹过来。旼侧过头看向他。","sourceParagraph":1913},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「你冷不冷？」","sourceParagraph":1914},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「还行。」","sourceParagraph":1915},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼的视线落向他露在外边的双手，指尖已经被夜风冻得泛出浅红。","sourceParagraph":1916},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「你的手都冻红了。」","sourceParagraph":1917},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕连忙把手插进外套口袋。","sourceParagraph":1918},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「风吹的。」","sourceParagraph":1919},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「活该。」","sourceParagraph":1920},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕低低笑出一点声音。","sourceParagraph":1921},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「嗯。」","sourceParagraph":1922},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼目视前方的道路，没有看他。","sourceParagraph":1923},{"type":"paragraph","text":"往前走了一小段路，她认真叮嘱。","sourceParagraph":1924},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「下次不要再像今晚这样。」","sourceParagraph":1925},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕轻轻点头：「好。」","sourceParagraph":1926},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「是真的听明白了？」","sourceParagraph":1927},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「应该明白了。」","sourceParagraph":1928},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼脚步一顿，停下看向他。","sourceParagraph":1929},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「什么叫应该。」","sourceParagraph":1930},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕也随之站定，认真整理自己的想法。","sourceParagraph":1931},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「如果我想要等你，我会提前跟你说。」","sourceParagraph":1932},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「嗯。」","sourceParagraph":1933},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「就算你回复不用，我也可以选择直接回宿舍。」","sourceParagraph":1934},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「嗯。」","sourceParagraph":1935},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕顿了顿，又生出疑问。","sourceParagraph":1936},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「那要是我心里还是很想等呢？」","sourceParagraph":1937},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼看向他，眼底浮起一点淡淡的戏谑。","sourceParagraph":1938},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「那你就等。」","sourceParagraph":1939},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕有几分意外。","sourceParagraph":1940},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「腿长在你身上，我总不能把你绑回去。」","sourceParagraph":1941},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一句半开玩笑的话，逗得幕弯起嘴角笑起来。","sourceParagraph":1942},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「但是，」旼话锋一转，神色重新认真，「不要把这件事，当成是你在为我做出牺牲。」","sourceParagraph":1943},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕脸上的笑意一点点敛下去，心头细细琢磨这句话。","sourceParagraph":1944},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼的目光投向远处路灯铺出来的漫漫长路。","sourceParagraph":1945},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「我并不愿意欠下这样一份人情。」","sourceParagraph":1946},{"type":"paragraph","text":"说完这句话，她安静下来，等待幕的回应。","sourceParagraph":1947},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕侧过脸望向她。","sourceParagraph":1948},{"type":"paragraph","text":"路灯从她身后洒落，把她的影子在地面拉得纤长，她并没有转头回望他。","sourceParagraph":1949},{"type":"paragraph","text":"直到这一刻，幕才恍然有所体悟。","sourceParagraph":1950},{"type":"paragraph","text":"原来旼也并非全然不在意「亏欠」二字，只是她极少把这份心思直白袒露出来。","sourceParagraph":1951},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「你也会觉得欠别人的吗。」幕轻声发问。","sourceParagraph":1952},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼沉默了很久，晚风拂动她耳边的碎发。","sourceParagraph":1953},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「会。」","sourceParagraph":1954},{"type":"paragraph","text":"这是她第一次坦然说出这件心事。","sourceParagraph":1955},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「如果别人自作主张，为我做了我并没有开口要求过的事，我心里就会背上很重的负担。」","sourceParagraph":1956},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「为什么会这样。」","sourceParagraph":1957},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「我自己也讲不太明白。」","sourceParagraph":1958},{"type":"paragraph","text":"她抬手向上提了提不断往下滑的帆布包肩带，神态带着一丝不自在，想来这样深层的心绪，从前很少和旁人谈起。","sourceParagraph":1959},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「或许是因为，我连选择接受或者拒绝的机会，一开始就没有得到。」","sourceParagraph":1960},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕安静地听着，把这句话牢牢记在心里。","sourceParagraph":1961},{"type":"paragraph","text":"走到宿舍分叉路口，旼停下脚步。","sourceParagraph":1962},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「到这边了。」","sourceParagraph":1963},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕颔首：「嗯。」","sourceParagraph":1964},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼转身走出两步，又回过头来。","sourceParagraph":1965},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「明天下午我还要出外景拍摄。」","sourceParagraph":1966},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「几点结束？」","sourceParagraph":1967},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「不知道。」","sourceParagraph":1968},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕看着她，旼也回望过来，像是在等候他说出某句话。","sourceParagraph":1969},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕仔细斟酌措辞之后开口。","sourceParagraph":1970},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「那我如果想要等你的话，会先问过你的意见。」","sourceParagraph":1971},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼的唇角极轻地动了动，背光之下，看不清完整的神情。","sourceParagraph":1972},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「可以。」","sourceParagraph":1973},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕追问：「要是你回复不用呢？」","sourceParagraph":1974},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「那就是真的不需要。」","sourceParagraph":1975},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「好。」","sourceParagraph":1976},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼微微点了下头，这一回，才真正转身走向宿舍楼。","sourceParagraph":1977},{"type":"paragraph","text":"第二天下午五点四十，幕收到旼发来的消息。","sourceParagraph":1979},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「今天可能八点才能收工。」","sourceParagraph":1980},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕扫了一眼手机，刚刚下课，楼道里还充斥着同学走动的喧闹。","sourceParagraph":1981},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他敲下一行字发送过去。","sourceParagraph":1982},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「要不要等你？」","sourceParagraph":1983},{"type":"paragraph","text":"几分钟之后，旼的回复弹了出来。","sourceParagraph":1984},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「不用。」","sourceParagraph":1985},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕盯着屏幕上简简单单两个字。","sourceParagraph":1986},{"type":"paragraph","text":"换作从前，看见「不用」、「不要」这类回答，他总会反复揣测，对方是不是出于客气，是不是怕给他添麻烦，内心其实是盼望，只是不好意思直说。","sourceParagraph":1987},{"type":"paragraph","text":"但今天，他不再做多余的脑补。","sourceParagraph":1988},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他回复：「好。」","sourceParagraph":1989},{"type":"paragraph","text":"之后便收拾书本，动身走向食堂。","sourceParagraph":1990},{"type":"paragraph","text":"晚上七点半，幕坐在图书馆那处老位置整理课堂笔记，手机屏幕轻轻亮起。","sourceParagraph":1991},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼发来消息：「提前结束了。」","sourceParagraph":1992},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕看了一眼，回：「哦。」","sourceParagraph":1993},{"type":"paragraph","text":"约莫十秒过去。","sourceParagraph":1994},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「你在哪。」","sourceParagraph":1995},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「图书馆。」","sourceParagraph":1996},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「老位置？」","sourceParagraph":1997},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「嗯。」","sourceParagraph":1998},{"type":"paragraph","text":"消息发送完毕，对话框归于安静。","sourceParagraph":1999},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕低下头继续翻看笔记，心底已经隐约预料到接下来会发生什么。","sourceParagraph":2000},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大约十五分钟，身侧的椅子被轻轻拉开，旼坐了下来。几缕发丝散乱地贴在脸颊，脸上还残留着没有卸干净的拍摄妆面，眼角泛着细碎的光泽，分不清是舞台高光，还是馆内灯光映照出来的。","sourceParagraph":2001},{"type":"paragraph","text":"她把书包搁在桌边，从包内取出一杯还冒着暖意的热豆浆，轻轻推到幕的面前。","sourceParagraph":2002},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「拿着。」","sourceParagraph":2003},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕看向纸杯升腾起的薄薄热气。","sourceParagraph":2004},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「给我的？」","sourceParagraph":2005},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「不然还能是给谁。」","sourceParagraph":2006},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕伸手接过来，纸杯外壳传来温热的触感。没有等温度再降，他低头抿下一大口。","sourceParagraph":2007},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼取出自己的书本翻开，指尖轻轻翻过纸页。","sourceParagraph":2008},{"type":"paragraph","text":"周遭安静流淌了片刻。","sourceParagraph":2009},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕忽然开口：「你昨天明明说，不用等。」","sourceParagraph":2010},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼指尖停在书页上，头也没有抬。","sourceParagraph":2011},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「你并没有留下来等。」","sourceParagraph":2012},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「嗯。」","sourceParagraph":2013},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「所以换我过来找你。」","sourceParagraph":2014},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕捧着温热的豆浆杯，一时无言。","sourceParagraph":2015},{"type":"paragraph","text":"过了一小会儿，旼抬眼看向他。","sourceParagraph":2016},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「怎么了？」","sourceParagraph":2017},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕轻轻摇了摇头。","sourceParagraph":2018},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「没什么。」","sourceParagraph":2019},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他再度低头喝了一口豆浆，甜度偏高，比平日里喝的要甜上不少，暖意顺着喉咙缓缓淌进心底。","sourceParagraph":2020},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夜晚回到宿舍，幕没有点开备忘录。","sourceParagraph":2022},{"type":"paragraph","text":"洗完澡，他靠坐在床沿，指尖划过手机，翻看白天的聊天记录。","sourceParagraph":2023},{"type":"paragraph","text":"屏幕上留存着寥寥几行对话：","sourceParagraph":2024},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「要不要等你？」","sourceParagraph":2025},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「不用。」","sourceParagraph":2026},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「好。」","sourceParagraph":2027},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「提前结束了。」","sourceParagraph":2028},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「你在哪。」","sourceParagraph":2029},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕望着这些文字，嘴角不受控制地向上弯起，浅浅地笑了。","sourceParagraph":2030},{"type":"paragraph","text":"上铺室友探下半个脑袋，带着几分打趣的语气。","sourceParagraph":2031},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「一个人盯着手机笑什么呢。」","sourceParagraph":2032},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕抬起头，神色恢复平淡。","sourceParagraph":2033},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「没什么。」","sourceParagraph":2034},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「你最近老是这样。」","sourceParagraph":2035},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「哪样。」","sourceParagraph":2036},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「抱着手机偷偷乐。」","sourceParagraph":2037},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕把手机倒扣在床单上。","sourceParagraph":2038},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「没有。」","sourceParagraph":2039},{"type":"paragraph","text":"室友打量他几秒，无奈叹一口气。","sourceParagraph":2040},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「谈恋爱的人都这么嘴硬吗。」","sourceParagraph":2041},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕没有接话。","sourceParagraph":2042},{"type":"paragraph","text":"隔了片刻，他重新拿起手机，给旼发消息。","sourceParagraph":2043},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「到宿舍了吗。」","sourceParagraph":2044},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼回复得十分迅速。","sourceParagraph":2045},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「到了。」","sourceParagraph":2046},{"type":"paragraph","text":"紧跟着又一条：「你呢。」","sourceParagraph":2047},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕看着屏幕输入。","sourceParagraph":2048},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「到了。」","sourceParagraph":2049},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼回过来一个句号。","sourceParagraph":2050},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕放下手机。他恍然发觉，今晚发生的许许多多细碎片段——礼堂台阶上五十多分钟的等候、一杯温热的豆浆、彼此试探的一问一答，他一条都没有往备忘录里面写。","sourceParagraph":2051},{"type":"paragraph","text":"可所有的细节，全部清清楚楚烙印在心底，不需要文字记录。","sourceParagraph":2052},{"type":"paragraph","text":"晚风穿过窗户缝隙吹进来，撩动窗帘，掀开小小的一角。","sourceParagraph":2053},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕躺倒在床上，脑海里反复回响着旼说过的话。","sourceParagraph":2054},{"type":"paragraph","text":"——你心里想要等，可以。","sourceParagraph":2055},{"type":"paragraph","text":"——但是你要先告诉我。","sourceParagraph":2056},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕缓缓合上眼皮。","sourceParagraph":2057},{"type":"paragraph","text":"原来亲近一个人，不只是懂得默默守候；同样也要学会开口询问，尊重对方的选择权。","sourceParagraph":2058},{"type":"image","assetId":"image16","sourceParagraph":2060}],"textChars":5427,"hanChars":4563,"imageCount":1}